WEBVTT

00:06:27.716 --> 00:06:30.845
that acknowledges the spectrum
of racial identities,

00:06:30.845 --> 00:06:35.266
a world where all the shades of greens,
purples and oranges

00:06:35.307 --> 00:06:39.228
are just as recognized as the reds,
yellows and blues.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:40.438
Thank you.

00:06:40.479 --> 00:06:43.858
(Cheers and applause)